        "notes": [
          {
            "category": "description",
            "text": "A flaw was found in ANGLE, a component within Chromium. This uninitialized resource vulnerability could allow a remote attacker, who has already compromised the renderer process, to read sensitive memory outside of the security sandbox. This exploitation can occur by tricking a user into visiting a specially crafted HTML page, leading to unauthorized information disclosure.",
