            "text": "A flaw was found in ANGLE, a component of Google Chrome on Android. This 'use after free' vulnerability allows a remote attacker to execute arbitrary code outside the browser's security sandbox. This can be exploited by enticing a user to visit a specially crafted HTML page. Successful exploitation could lead to a complete compromise of the affected device.",
